From: Dekum69 <87270170+Dekum69@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:17:53 +0545
Subject: [PATCH] feat(Instagram): local view history for posts, Reels and
 Stories

Ported from PR #1952 onto current main. Records every feed post, Reel and
Story the user views into a local SQLite database and shows them in a
two-column viewer activity reachable from Piko settings -> History.

- ViewHistoryHook: injected logger plus the history entry point
- HistoryActivity: plain-framework grid, paged, clear/delete/copy link
- ThumbnailCache: async loader with an in-memory LruCache
- PikoHistoryDb: 2000-row store keyed by media_pk, self-healing schema
- FeedViewHistoryPatch: viewed_impression callback
- ReelsViewHistoryPatch: ClipsViewerViewPagerListener.onPageSelected
- StoriesViewHistoryPatch: ReelViewerFragment.onCurrentActiveItemBound
- ViewHistorySettingsPatch / HistoryResourcePatch: settings + manifest
- GetPostTypeExtensionFingerprint: getPostTypeKey (not getPostType), which
  keeps the "clips" literal intact so Reels stay detected
